# Ory Polis (boxyhq/jackson) console-managed settings — SSO-01, Phase 13 (IN-02).
#
# This file is consumed by the `polis` compose service via `env_file:` (read at
# container CREATE). It holds ONLY the NON-secret, allowlisted settings the
# console may edit through `PUT /api/config/polis` (see backend
# config_edit/polis.rs::POLIS_EDITABLE). It is the merge BASE the writer upserts
# into; the writer never writes a secret here (those live in `.env` / the compose
# `environment:` block, which WINS on any duplicate key).
#
# Committed as a placeholder so `env_file` is present on a first boot (before any
# console edit). The console rewrites it in place on every edit (comments are NOT
# preserved across a console PUT — see IN-01). Safe to leave at these defaults.
#
# NOTE: a bare broker restart re-starts the existing container and does NOT
# re-read this file; an edited value is fully ingested by Polis on the next
# `docker compose up`/recreate.
LOG_LEVEL=info
BOXYHQ_NO_TELEMETRY=1
